        "payload": "tree a3819d69336683c4436b10f070ce4fba619bbb71\nparent 9523d2b4a185c704994ef44d2229c3d1604cb9e5\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1791372711 +0900\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1791375436 +0900\n\ntest: characterize restart after pruned refetch\n\nRestore the highest pruned block so startup verification reaches its missing undo before an older missing block body.\nRecord the existing restart failure and verify that the chain tip and restored block survive restarting with the default shallow checks.\n",
